*** Comments ***
Example of private keywords made of other keywords: no programming needed.
Copy this file to a name ending with .resource (here, in this folder that git ignores, or in a folder listed in
[uitests] keywords_dirs of config.toml) and adapt it. Its keywords are then usable in every test, and listed by
'jsa uitests keywords'.

*** Keywords ***
Create Contact
    [Documentation]    Create a contact with its email, and save it.
    ...
    ...    Example: ``Create Contact    Jane Doe    jane@example.com``
    [Arguments]    ${name}    ${email}
    Open Menu    Contacts
    Create Record
    Set Field    name    ${name}
    Set Field    Email    ${email}
    Save Record
